;; The rights authority for release publication. Its bytes are hashed into
;; every manifest as `admission.policy_hash`, so the terms recorded below and
;; the terms a release publishes cannot diverge.
;;
;; :rights-publication  the one state that authorizes publishing at all.
;; :rights-statement    the grant published in each manifest's `rights` field.
;;                      :works is the standing of the underlying Aozora texts;
;;                      :encoding is the licence over Soranoha's own encoding
;;                      and derived artifacts. :statement-url
;;                      must resolve to the full statement before genesis.
;;                      It is the w3id form: this URL is published in every
;;                      manifest and every TEI file, so it outlives any host.
{:rights-publication :assessment-required
 :rights-statement {:works "public-domain"
                    :encoding "CC0-1.0"
                    :statement-url "https://w3id.org/soranoha/rights"}}
